# skhd configuration
# Read from $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/skhd/skhdrc (i.e. ~/.config/skhd/skhdrc).
# The macOS installer symlinks it here.
#
# Intentionally empty. Window-manager keybindings moved to OmniWM, which ships
# its own keybinding manager — they live in the `hotkeys` array of
# config/omniwm/settings.toml. skhd is kept (and started by the installer) for
# any future non-WM hotkeys you want to add below.
#
# OmniWM's IPC is enabled (general.ipcEnabled = true), so `omniwmctl` is
# available as an optional fallback for anything its built-in bindings can't
# express, e.g.:
#   omniwmctl command consume-or-expel-window-left
